    (see LICENSE-LGPL-2.1.txt).

The ported source files keep the LGPL-2.1 terms. The rest of Skyrim
Androidborn remains MIT-licensed (see ../LICENSE).

The .proto files under src/main/proto come from SteamTracking/Protobufs
(Valve Corporation), released into the public domain (see
LICENSE-PROTOBUFS). The Java classes under src/main/java/steam/proto were
generated from them with protoc 25.5 and are used for interoperability with
the Steam network.

The Steam name and service belong to Valve Corporation. This module is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Valve.
